<text:h text:style-name="Heading_20_1" text:outline-level="1">Introduction</text:h>
<text:p><text:bookmark-start text:name="start"/>This report has <text:span text:style-name="T1">red bold Sans</text:span> text, <text:span text:style-name="T2">highlighting</text:span>, a <text:a xlink:type="simple" xlink:href="https://example.org/">hyperlink</text:a>, a picture <draw:frame draw:name="Chart picture" text:anchor-type="as-char" svg:width="2cm" svg:height="1cm"><draw:image><office:binary-data>iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACgAAAAUCAIAAABwJOjsAAAAJElEQVR4nGM4ISc3IIhh1OJRi0ctHrV41OJRi0ctHrV45FgMAFLhLK5mrmiuAAAAAElFTkSuQmCC</office:binary-data></draw:image></draw:frame> and a footnote<text:note text:id="n1" text:note-class="footnote"><text:note-citation>1</text:note-citation><text:note-body><text:p>The footnote text.</text:p></text:note-body></text:note>.<text:bookmark-end text:name="start"/></text:p>
<text:p>Tracked: <text:change-start text:change-id="ct1"/>new words<text:change-end text:change-id="ct1"/> and <text:change text:change-id="ct2"/>after deletion. An endnote<text:note text:id="n2" text:note-class="endnote"><text:note-citation>i</text:note-citation><text:note-body><text:p>The endnote text.</text:p></text:note-body></text:note>.</text:p>
<text:p>A comment here<office:annotation><dc:creator>Bob</dc:creator><dc:date>2024-05-02T09:00:00</dc:date><text:p>Please check this.</text:p></office:annotation> in the text.</text:p>
